        <div class="step-body" id="body-1">
          <p>Last week you described a QR code generator in words and got a working one. It lives inside the AI’s chat window right now - and that is not convenient at all. Today you’ll save it as a real file on your own computer, open it in your browser, and then make it yours: a default color you chose, a color picker, and your initials right in the middle of the code.</p>
