          <p>When you’re done, you’ll scan it with your phone and it will still work.</p>
          <p><strong>Definition of Done:</strong> qr-code.html is in your vibe-coding folder, makes a QR code in your chosen color with your initials in the middle, and scans on a phone.</p>
